.claude/

# Site packages MUST commit their manifest + emitted JSON Schemas —
# atlas §0 keystone primitive. The `manifest-integrity` CI check
# (atlas §9 #7) diffs the freshly-built manifest against the committed
# one to catch packages shipped with stale manifests. Compiled JS
# (dist/*.js, dist/*.d.ts) is NOT committed; consumers run `tsc` /
# `sitely build` themselves.
!packages/site-*/dist/
packages/site-*/dist/*
!packages/site-*/dist/manifest.json
!packages/site-*/dist/schemas/
!packages/site-*/dist/schemas/**
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs/api
docs/sites
docs/public/playground-data.json
docs/.vitepress/dist
docs/.vitepress/cache
